WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:01.689
Hey Thoughty2 here.

00:00:01.689 --> 00:00:07.549
Gentlemen, I have a question for you, how
many wives do you think you could handle?

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:09.790
Surely one is enough.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:12.170
Well according to many, no.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:17.400
Polygamy is legal and commonly practiced in
many countries throughout Africa, the Middle-East

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.780
and South-East Asia.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:24.570
But for one man, becoming betrothed to even
two or three different women isn’t sufficient.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:33.620
A man known simply as Ziona has a grand total
of 39 wives and he is the head of the world’s

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:34.970
largest family.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:40.370
Astonishingly he also has 94 children and
33 grandchildren.

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:45.150
This enormous family lives in Baktawng village
in Northeast India.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:49.149
This quirky village is built up a hillside,
hundreds of miles from anywhere.

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:56.620
And at its heart sits a bright purple castle
called "Chhuan Thar Run" which means the “House

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:58.289
of the New Generation”.

00:00:58.289 --> 00:01:05.630
This purple monstrosity is home to all 193
members of the Ziona family.

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:12.219
Now aged 72, Ziona married his first wife
at the humble age of 15 in 1959.

00:01:12.219 --> 00:01:17.939
Since then he has added a new woman to his
bridal harem, every one and a half years,

00:01:17.939 --> 00:01:18.939
on average.

00:01:18.939 --> 00:01:21.700
And in one year he married 10 women!

00:01:21.700 --> 00:01:27.290
So do all 39 wives sleep in one gigantic bed
with their man?

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:31.880
As cosy as that sounds, it’s actually a
rather cold arrangement.

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:36.270
His wives are resigned to sleeping in large
communal dorms.

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:41.789
The youngest women sleep closest to Ziona’s
bedroom, the older women sleep in a dorm further

00:01:41.789 --> 00:01:42.789
away.

00:01:42.789 --> 00:01:48.789
As for Ziona’s bed, well he only has room
for one woman at a time, so how does he decide

00:01:48.789 --> 00:01:52.700
who gets to share his almighty presence each
night?

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:58.979
The women are on a rotation and reportedly,
the female who is chosen for duty that night,

00:01:58.979 --> 00:02:02.159
will find a pillow missing from her own bed.

00:02:02.159 --> 00:02:05.420
The romance is strong with this one.

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:08.619
Mealtimes are a highly regimented affair.

00:02:08.619 --> 00:02:14.850
All 39 wives must muck in each night to provide
a feast of truly grand proportions.

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:21.650
Every night the wives must pluck and prepare
30 chickens, peel 60kg of potatoes and cook

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:24.980
over 100kg of rice.

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:29.320
Schooling is somewhat of an issue, because
the local village school is not large enough

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:33.660
to accommodate the vast army of children belonging
to the Ziona family.

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:34.660
The solution?

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:41.170
Ziona built his own school exclusively for
his 94 children and ever resourceful, the

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:44.600
eldest children in the family are the teachers.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:47.470
But it doesn’t end at education.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:53.420
Ziona’s sons and daughters also form the
local football league, making up several different

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:56.750
teams, and they compete against each other
regularly.

00:02:56.750 --> 00:03:01.370
Ziona’s wives take turns in waiting hand
and foot on their husband.

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:05.230
At least eight women will serve him each day.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:12.220
Strangely all the women get along, they all
have love and a mutual respect of each other.

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:19.810
Not only is this a large family, but a fully-functioning
sweat shop, to put it crudely.

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:26.819
Ziona is a wealthy man because his family
manufactures and sells furniture, hundreds

00:03:26.819 --> 00:03:28.750
of pieces of it each year.

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:34.650
Their purple mansion consists of several carpentry
workshops and all of the family members who

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:37.300
are old enough work for the family business.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:42.770
But here’s the thing, in India polygamy
IS illegal.

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:49.150
However, in these remote tribal lands of India
it is permitted for local religions to set

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:53.000
their own laws in regards to certain things
including polygamy.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:04:01.900
Conveniently Ziona happens to have his own
religion – I know, what are the chances?

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:07.980
And amazingly his religion happens to make
polygamy legal for all who follow it.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:14.270
Ziona is head of the religion, which is actually
a Christian sect known as “Chana Pawl”.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.680
The entire family prays daily.

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:21.359
And Ziona himself is granted almost godlike
status within the village.

00:04:21.359 --> 00:04:26.099
Women in the community feel as though it’s
an honour to be wed to the man, which explains

00:04:26.099 --> 00:04:28.129
why he has so many wives.

00:04:28.129 --> 00:04:35.909
So let’s be realistic here, Ziona has basically
created a cult with a very loyal following,

00:04:35.909 --> 00:04:39.189
with the goal of perpetuating his multi-wife
fantasies.

00:04:39.189 --> 00:04:49.370
There’s got to be easier ways to be a player,
I mean this guy’s obviously never heard

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:50.599
of Tinder.

00:04:50.599 --> 00:05:02.099
Thanks for watching.

